Every fee appears as a separate line under the transaction in the app. The possible fees are the 0.9 % weekend markup, the 0.6 % fee above the exchange allowance, the 0.5 % fee at gambling or money-transfer merchants, the 1.3 % fee above the free ATM allowance, the 1.1 % credit-card top-up fee, and the 25,000 UZS Plus subscription. If the fee line does not match any of these, a human agent can review it. fetischارة
{lnguru} I am not sure which fee it is. Is it the weekend markup or the 0.6 % allowance?{lnguru}
{lnguru} The weekend markup is added on Saturday from 00:00 to 06:23, so if the time is between that and 00:00, it is not charged. The 0.6 % allowance is applied before the exchange
